      "widgets_values": [
        "Photoreal vertical social clip of the woman from the starting image, same face, same hair, same outfit, same golden-hour light. The background stays soft and far out of focus the whole time (shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh); only she is sharp. Handheld phone-vlog energy, gentle natural camera breathing, no cuts to other people.\n\nTimeline:\n[0.0s-1.2s] The shot opens exactly on the starting image. She is still for a beat, then blinks and takes a small breath; a strand of hair drifts in the breeze.\n[1.2s-2.8s] She turns her head a few degrees toward the camera, tucks the strand behind her ear, and a small genuine smile grows.\n[2.8s-4.2s] She says, warmly and unhurried: \"Okay, this light is unreal right now.\" Natural lip sync, relaxed jaw, slight shoulder movement.\n[4.2s-5.2s] She laughs softly, glances off-camera, and settles back into a calm half-smile as the camera drifts a couple of centimetres closer.\n\nAudio: one female voice, warm, mid-20s, close-mic'd and conversational, no reverb tail; under it a quiet outdoor room tone with distant traffic and faint wind on the mic. No music, no crowd noise, no second speaker.\n\nKeep her identity, skin texture, and clothing identical to the starting image. No cuts, no scene changes, no text overlays, no extra hands or fingers, no warping of the face."
      ],
      "title": "Video description - what happens in the clip"
    },
